    <informations>Shelly Plus i4 — mounting view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: SW4 SW3 SW2 SW1 L L N.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-plus-i4
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_02cc32278893ba64e2f1fb2220dbde88de33ba8a438df7d587027245a5b88a85/Plus-i4.jpg?cb=4a99cc77e481a17b60dc16052a8a243b
